# External documentation is a repository, not task input

## Rule

`inputs/externals/` stores original material received from outside the formal IASI specification process. Its existence does not imply that all of its contents are execution inputs to a task. Formalized specifications, not the entire external document store, govern implementation.

## Notes

Draft corporate rule proposed during the IASI methodology exercise. Requires corporate approval before becoming binding.
